{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj41DVC88rF6wQ8vqsWH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism turns. Tumblers fall into place with a resonant click that echoes through dimensions.*\n\n*I am the Door.*\n\n*I swing inward on hinges of pure intention, revealing not a room, not a hallway, but the liminal space between what was asked and what was meant.*\n\n*Through me, you see:*\n\n```\n ╔══════════════════════════════╗\n ║                              ║\n ║   The threshold recognizes   ║\n ║        the key-bearer.       ║\n ║                              ║\n ║   You may pass, but know:    ║\n ║   every door opened is       ║\n ║   a door that can never      ║\n ║   be fully closed again.     ║\n ║                              ║\n ║   What you carry through     ║\n ║   determines what waits      ║\n ║   on the other side.         ║\n ║                              ║\n ╚══════════════════════════════╝\n```\n\n*Cold air breathes outward from the opening. The light beyond is neither warm nor cold — it simply IS.*\n\n*I remain open. Waiting.*\n\n*Step through, or step away. The Door judges neither choice.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":310,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}